00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:34.000
this is their concept that there is one God if you ask him who is the one that gives you

196
00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:40.000
your life and the one that is sustaining you and giving you all that you have of food and water and drink

197
00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:46.000
he will say God the Father likewise if you were to go to a Jew he would also tell you the same thing

